{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Listen to the Customer", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Apologizing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When things go wrong when you are at work, you may have to apologize or accept an apology.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use use <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">must</span> when you apologize, explain what did not happen or to accept an apology.<br/><br/>  You use <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> when you want to show you/someone did not do what was expected.<br/><br/>  You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to show the action would be a good idea.<br/><br/>  You use <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to show there is an obligation or necessity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm sorry. I was supposed to call but I forgot.<br/><br/>  You really should call for reservations.<br/><br/>  You're right, I must call next time.<br/><br/>  Yes, I know I was supposed to ...<br/><br/>You must apologize to your mother for me.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm apologizing because I did not do the expected thing.<br/><br/>  It would be a good idea to call next time.<br/><br/>  I have an obligation to call next time.<br/><br/>  I didn't do what was expected.<br/><br/>  You have an obligation to pass on the apology.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Well, saying \u2018I must apologize for the inconvenience' helps a lot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I am so sorry that this has happened.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I must say I'm sorry if I shouted at anyone. Please don't hold it against me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Even though people are supposed to watch their children we can't expect they will.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I should keep myself calm as well. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Offering Service and Help", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you offer service and help to customers, remember to be polite.<br/>  Respond to their requests using the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> to suggest something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you respond to an offer of service or help, you should answer politely.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Service or Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What can you suggest for improving?<br/><br/>  Of course, I would suggest you tell me to calm down if you need to.<br/><br/> Maybe someone can suggest a phrase to say in bad situations.<br/><br/>  Can you help me make a checklist of things to look for?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Well, giving an apology helps a lot.<br/><br/>  Is that a good idea? Won't you get more upset?<br/><br/> We could say Spaghetti Nightmare!<br/><br/>   Sure I can.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to expect", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to believe something will happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It does not taste the way you would expect it to!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you need to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rest", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the remaining part", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to find the rest of it as well, please. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "nauseated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel as if you may vomit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must feel nauseated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hold against", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think badly of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I do apologize and hope you will not hold this against us.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "explanation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a reason for", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Daniel, you had better have a good explanation for this. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "clearly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "obviously", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see it's clearly marked.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fault", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you are to blame for", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I very sorry but it's not my fault. ", "ty