{"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le02ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We've had to deal with a lot of problems this week. What can anyone suggest for improvement?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tanya</span>: Well, giving an apology like \u2018I must apologize for the inconvenience' helps a lot.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: We'd better check supplies when we open them to make sure they're okay.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tanya</span>: I agree with Daniel. We might want to do that regularly. Having customers feel nauseated is not what we want!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le02ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We don't want our customers to be upset. Everything ought to be to their satisfaction. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tanya</span>: We ought to keep a watch on some tables like that one with the spaghetti! What a mess that was! Even though people are supposed to watch their children we can't expect they will.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: Even when things clearly aren't our fault, sometimes an explanation and a strong apology like \u2018I am so sorry that this  happened' makes customers happy.", "id": 2, "time": "21400", "image": "engenn8le02ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I should keep myself calm as well. I must say I'm sorry if I shouted at anyone. Please don't hold it against me. Of course, I also suggest you tell me to calm down if you need to.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tanya</span>: Is that a good idea? Won't you get more upset?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... Maybe someone can suggest a phrase to say in bad situations.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: We could say Spaghetti Nightmare!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Daniel, you're very resourceful. Can you help me make a list of things to remember?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: Sure I can.", "id": 3, "time": "44500", "image": "engenn8le02ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le02ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}